      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA beautifully appointed country residence with equestrian facilities\n\nBridgetown is an impressive country residence occupying a private and mature setting on about 21.5 acres of good-quality pastureland. Approached through a gated entrance and along a sweeping tree-lined driveway, the property immediately conveys a strong sense of arrival, privacy and exclusivity. Set amidst beautifully maintained grounds and paddocks, the residence enjoys a peaceful rural setting while benefiting from excellent connectivity to Roscommon Town, Athlone and Galway.\n\nOccupying an elevated position overlooking its own lands, the residence commands attractive views across the surrounding countryside. Mature trees, landscaped lawns and well-defined boundaries create an idyllic setting, perfectly suited to family living. Extending to a generous scale throughout, the residence is presented to an exceptionally high standard, with bright, well-proportioned interiors thoughtfully designed for modern lifestyles. A striking double-height entrance hall with feature staircase creates an immediate sense of space and elegance on arrival, setting the tone for the quality and finish evident throughout the home.\n\nAt the heart of the property lies a superb open-plan kitchen, breakfast and dining area. Beautifully appointed with bespoke solid wood cabinetry, polished granite worktops, a peninsula island and a Belling induction range cooker, this impressive space successfully combines practicality with timeless style. Large windows and glazed doors flood the room with natural light while providing seamless access to the patio and gardens, making it equally suited to everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nThe reception accommodation is equally impressive, comprising a selection of generously proportioned living spaces finished in warm neutral tones and complemented by quality flooring, feature fireplaces and attractive countryside views. A substantial dual-aspect family room provides an inviting setting for relaxation, while a separate living room and dedicated home office offer excellent flexibility for modern family life, remote working and home-based business needs.\n\nOn the first floor, a spacious gallery landing leads to five beautifully presented bedrooms. The master bedroom suite is particularly impressive and features a walk-in wardrobe together with a luxurious ensuite bathroom finished to a high specification. Four further double bedrooms provide comfortable and versatile accommodation, one of which also benefits from ensuite facilities. A beautifully appointed family bathroom, complete with bath and separate shower, serves the remaining bedrooms.\n\nThroughout, the property has been well maintained and finished to an exacting standard, offering a superb balance of elegant accommodation, practical family living space and modern comfort.\n\nOutside\n\nComplementing the residence is a substantial detached garage building incorporating twin garage bays and a superb first-floor entertainment room, currently used as guest accommodation, including a bathroom. With independent access, this versatile space is ideally suited to a variety of recreational, leisure, home office or ancillary accommodation uses, subject to any necessary consents.\n\nThe property enjoys an outstanding range of equestrian and agricultural facilities. A steel-framed shed with profile metal cladding and roofing is centred around a large concrete yard, providing extensive hardstanding for vehicle manoeuvring, machinery storage and general operational use. Internally, the building incorporates six stables, two foaling bays, a tack room, W.C., horse wash bay and a dedicated hay/storage area, making it exceptionally well equipped for equestrian purposes.\n\nIn addition, there is a second detached steel-framed agricultural shed with concrete flooring and excellent storage capacity, suitable for fodder, machinery, livestock housing or a variety of general agricultural uses.\n\nFurther enhancing the holding are two sand arenas, comprising a principal riding arena and a dedicated lunging arena, together with well-defined paddocks enclosed by high-quality stock-proof fencing. The fencing infrastructure was comprehensively upgraded in 2025, creating secure and well-defined paddocks. The lands are ideally suited to equestrian, hobby farming and lifestyle use, making this a superb turnkey country and equestrian property."
      },
